OL,3,GNEWSA'Inconceivable' that Irish
OL,4,Agovernment would not hold Omagh inquiry
OL,5,A- Sir Chris Bryant
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Omagh Bombing Inquiry is
OL,8,Finvestigating whether the attack on 15
OL,9,FAugust 1998, in which 29 people
OL,10,Fincluding a woman pregnant with twins
OL,11,Fwere killed, could have been prevented.
